{"version":1,"content":"<p>最新流出的路線圖信息顯示，AMD下一代面向消費市場的Zen 7處理器平台可能要等到2029年才會正式亮相，同時還將搭載升級版RDNA 5+集成顯卡架構。這一消息進一步勾勒出AMD未來數年的移動處理器發展規劃，也暗示RDNA 5架構全面進入主流移動市場仍需等待相當長時間。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584878.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:01:26.072345+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:42:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_hash":"5bf22bbe8b8f1466214c9dbcdad5c282b1d4feaa9cc48e6ad1c8496d13cd14a8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}